# Keep the legacy local-file server and its setup-only tooling out of the
# Vercel deployment entirely. Without this, Vercel's zero-config build was
# picking up server.js and running it — it tried to copy data/seed.json to
# data/db.json on Vercel's read-only filesystem and crashed every request
# with EROFS. None of api/*.js ever requires any of these at runtime
# (confirmed by grep before adding this file), so excluding them is safe.
server.js
data/
sql/
scripts/
